<p>WastedToken Mint began in a converted print shop in Lisbon with a single hydraulic press, a borrowed die, and a stubborn belief: the most important things in crypto are not the things you can lose. They are the things you keep on your desk, hand to a friend, or drop in a fountain for luck.</p>
<p>We mint in small batches. Every coin is struck, polished, and serialised by hand. No two runs are identical. When a series sells out, the die is broken. When a new one begins, the countdown starts on-chain and the strike list is locked.</p>
<p>Our metals come from certified refiners. Our designs are drawn by the community. Our reputation is the only thing we cannot restrike.</p>
